BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SIFF & CFC Present The Dark Crystal with DJ NicFit
DTSTART:20250521T013000Z
DTEND:20250521T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20250521T013000Z
UID:ZyCoWJibT5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nJoin the Gelflings (and Fizzgig!)
  on their quest to defeat the evil Skeksis in this very special presentati
 on of The Dark Crystal. This time\, Seattle’s own DJ NicFit will create 
 a live soundtrack to accompany Jim Henson and Frank Oz’s cult 1982 fanta
 sy adventure. Classified Cinema will be giving out stickers and film poste
 rs made exclusively for this one-time-only event in the lobby before the s
 how! Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/siff-and-cfc-present-t
 he-dark-crystal-with-dj-nicfit
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
